{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "de",
  "language_raw": "German",
  "source": "message/dat/German/script/sub_028.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/German/script/sub_028.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_00",
      "hash64": "D1EDE1F9BC47230F",
      "text": "Nanu...? Ich spüre, wie abenteuerlich deine\\nvergangenen Leben gewesen sein müssen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_01",
      "hash64": "D1EDE0F9BC47215C",
      "text": "Ich kann Erinnerungen an deine vergangenen\\nLeben sehen, indem ich dein Smart-Rotom\\r\\nuntersuche. Möchtest du es ausprobieren?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_02",
      "hash64": "D1EDE3F9BC472675",
      "text": "Hmm, vielleicht lassen wir es auch lieber.\\nDas Ganze klingt schon etwas suspekt, oder?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_03",
      "hash64": "D1EDE2F9BC4724C2",
      "text": "Jaaaa, ich sehe sie... deine Vergangenheit...\\nHm, diese Umgebung... Wo lebtest du früher?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_028_select_a",
      "hash64": "35D0BFAD69D0E96D",
      "text": "Kanto?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_028_select_b",
      "hash64": "35D0BCAD69D0E454",
      "text": "Galar?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_028_select_c",
      "hash64": "35D0BDAD69D0E607",
      "text": "Sinnoh?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_028_select_d",
      "hash64": "35D0BAAD69D0E0EE",
      "text": "Hisui?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_028_select_e",
      "hash64": "35D0BBAD69D0E2A1",
      "text": "Ich hab’s mir anders überlegt...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_04",
      "hash64": "D1EDDDF9BC471C43",
      "text": "Der Schleier fällt, das Bild wird deutlicher!\\nIn einem deiner früheren Leben...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_a",
      "hash64": "036CE3FECEFF3FC2",
      "text": "...sehe ich dich mit deinem Partner-Pokémon\\ndurch ganz Kanto reisen. „Let’s go!“, rufst du.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_b",
      "hash64": "036CE2FECEFF3E0F",
      "text": "...sehe ich dich in Galar Herausforderungen\\nmit Dynamax-Pokémon meistern!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_c",
      "hash64": "036CE1FECEFF3C5C",
      "text": "...sehe ich dich im Untergrund von Sinnoh graben\\nund das Publikum bei Super-Wettbewerbs-Shows\\r\\nbegeistern!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_d",
      "hash64": "036CE0FECEFF3AA9",
      "text": "...sehe ich dich mit einem seltsamen Handy in der\\nHand ein großes Abenteuer in Hisui bestreiten...\\c\\nMoment, von dieser Hisui-Region habe ich noch\\nnie gehört. Wo ist das denn?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_05",
      "hash64": "D1EDDCF9BC471A90",
      "text": "Wohlan, ich werde eine Handyhülle für dein\\nSmart-Rotom entwerfen, die von deinen\\r\\nErinnerungen inspiriert ist.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_06",
      "hash64": "D1EDDFF9BC471FA9",
      "text": "Uuuund... fertig!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_07",
      "hash64": "D1EDDEF9BC471DF6",
      "text": "Deine Handyhülle ist fertig! Hier, bitte sehr.\\nIch hoffe, sie gefällt dir.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sub_028_system_a",
      "hash64": "4AF36B673E33A1D0",
      "text": "Du erhältst die [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Pikavoli-Handyhülle[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sub_028_system_b",
      "hash64": "4AF36E673E33A6E9",
      "text": "Du erhältst die [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Ballduin-Handyhülle[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sub_028_system_c",
      "hash64": "4AF36D673E33A536",
      "text": "Du erhältst die [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Pokétch-Handyhülle[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sub_028_system_d",
      "hash64": "4AF370673E33AA4F",
      "text": "Du erhältst die [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]ArceusPhone-Handyhülle[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_08",
      "hash64": "D1EDE9F9BC4730A7",
      "text": "Wenn du noch mehr über deine früheren Leben\\nerfahren möchtest, weißt du, wo du mich findest.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_09",
      "hash64": "D1EDE8F9BC472EF4",
      "text": "Ich habe noch nie jemanden getroffen, der in\\nfrüheren Leben so viele Abenteuer erlebt hat\\r\\nwie du. Danke, dass ich daran teilhaben durfte!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sub_028_middlef_10",
      "hash64": "D1EA5BF9BC440986",
      "text": "Na, gefallen dir deine Handyhüllen? Sie stecken\\nvoller Erinnerungen an vergangene Leben.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
